/v1/","context":{"app_id":4484810,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-4484810","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T09:01:46Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4665710","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4484810-1846651706685973","game_id":"steam-4484810","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update - Just for Next Fest!","summary":"Hiya Friend!We've update our demo for Steam Next Fest! 🎉 It's still a small slice of our little game, so here is what we've been able to add to make the world feel a little more live for you all: 🎮The Technical Stuff:Controller Support - this is a bit more intuitive now and should be working better on steam deckOptimization - We've done a lot of work to optimize the game, so it should be working a little better in general and a bit better on Steam Deck. For SteamDeck - our goal is for consistent","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T02:11:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685973","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4484810-1842846814449466","game_id":"steam-4484810","kind":"announcement","title":"The Snowy Trail Ahead - Devlog!","summary":"Hiya Friends! This is our first ever devlog 😮. We've been a little quiet the past couple of months, just keeping our head down and working hard, so we thought you all deserved an update. Recently we have been working on The Docks, the 3rd area of our game. This includes making new characters, new buildings, and keeping our quests in mind. Here are two of our favorite NPCs:Coco - the owner of Coco's Cafe! A cute little ocelot with a twin in The Park. The sibling rivalry is strong but they work to","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-05T17:14:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814449466","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4484810-1839676055889055","game_id":"steam-4484810","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Out Now! ☃️❄️","summary":"Hey everyone! Our demo is now avaliable! 🎉 Come help out the community of Winterlight Harbor by clearing the snow away from the first area of our game: The Neighborhood. Enjoy the first 15 minutes of our cozy snow cleaning game - build some snowmen, set up some firepits, and help make the Neighborhood safe for your neighbors. We did our best with this little demo, so we really hope you like what you see ❤️If you do, please leave a review and tell us what you enjoyed or what you are excited to se","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T18:28:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055889055","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4484810-1836506165576451","game_id":"steam-4484810","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest - Sign Ups","summary":"Hiya Friends! If you are into messing with games as they develop, breaking games to find all the bugs, and giving feedback to devs, then we would love it if you signed up for our Playtest!⭐ This playtest will help us make a polished Demo for the future and finalize details for the full game!You'll get notified when the playtest goes live and will have about 1 week from that point to send us any feedback you might have (there is a link to the form included in the game or you can email us! Mangole","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-06T17:35:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165576451","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4484810-1834602721183833","game_id":"steam-4484810","kind":"announcement","title":"10,000 Wishlists!?","summary":"Hiya Friends! Honestly can't believe we can say this - Winter Whiskers just reached ⭐ 10,000 wishlists ⭐ today! We are truely blown away by the reception our little snow cleaning game has gotten so far. The 10k milestone is one that a lot of game devs talk about, it can help a lot with visibility as a game continues to grow, reach launch time, and even post launch. So thank you, so so much, for helping us reach this goal crazy early on! Your support really means the world to us, we hope we can l","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-03T04:01:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721183833","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4484810":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:05Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:04Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4484810":"2026-10-26T02:33:05Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4484810":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:04Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:04Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4665710":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:05Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:05Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4484810","app_id":4484810,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:37Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"ko